---
import ContentLayout from '../../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import { maps } from '../../data/game.js';
---
<ContentLayout
  title="All Maps"
  description="All six ARC Raiders maps — Dam Battlegrounds, Buried City, Spaceport, Blue Gate, Stella Montis and Riven Tides — with difficulty ratings and what each is best farmed for."
  eyebrow="Maps"
  heading="Six battlegrounds, six reasons to drop"
  lede="Each map rewards something different. Picking the right one for what you need that session matters more than raw skill."
>
  <div class="map-grid">
    {maps.map(m => (
      <a class="hud-card map-card" href={`/maps/${m.slug}`}>
        <span class="tag">{m.difficulty}</span>
        <h3>{m.name}</h3>
        <p>{m.blurb}</p>
        <p class="best-for">Best for: <strong>{m.bestFor}</strong></p>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2>Map conditions change the rules</h2>
  <p>
    Maps run modified variants that cycle on a schedule. There are two tiers —
    Minor and Major — plus a separate ARC Operations variant. Minor conditions
    add events that boost particular loot types, and some trials can only be
    completed while one is active. Major conditions change the atmosphere and
    mechanics of the map outright, raising both difficulty and loot value.
  </p>
  <p>
    Named conditions in rotation include EM Storm, Hurricane, Bird City,
    Flashpoint and Night Raids. As of update 1.42.0 the schedule is offset by
    region rather than run globally, so condition timings now line up with local
    peak hours instead of a single worldwide clock.
  </p>

  <h2>Which map should you actually run?</h2>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table class="data-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Goal</th><th>Map</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Learning the game</strong></td><td>Dam Battlegrounds</td><td>Lowest risk in the rotation.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Farming coins</strong></td><td>Buried City or Stella Montis</td><td>Best loot value per run.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Boss farming</strong></td><td>Dam Battlegrounds</td><td>Community-standard boss farm.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>PvP</strong></td><td>Buried City</td><td>Highest player traffic of any map.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</ContentLayout>

<style>
  .map-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .map-card { color: var(--color-text); display: block; }
  .map-card:hover { text-decoration: none; border-color: var(--color-arc-teal); }
  .map-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .best-for { margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .best-for strong { color: var(--color-rust-bright); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .map-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .map-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
